e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nrnr18uaDnEQ7kNvwGbGRiQ&_nc_oc=AdpPjIB4NVsA1XJxpymIq2N9hht5fXvScUPpFQUoQyMyjXFx9ZCHN2gG8B8Zp_VvaT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0EUHhAmeHZy-CehTTeYlAyzRkuWnvv7JzCB7bLy9GHLg&oe=69E75AB9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5ht0nq8cC3QQ7kNvwGRtEq2&_nc_oc=AdrU68USKIfy3nLi02LexJeXFDpEIlUvARX59ezhZaV_buIJiE-OD3D3cL-rwUmGmbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0BJrpoh2D4qyJuHvHGokca3EY4ITLYkb1XyxSZbTNi1g&oe=69E76A53"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=819UEtKPzScQ7kNvwGZ9waz&_nc_oc=AdrSJ5qC1njAYJQjToF4-X7Mp3gQZ73z7KuL5gIXaB1xybnmUVBLEAWSC9bNRHoKhD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1tze4pO0Mvet2ynzoGIYsuWVaN3Yq-lcr9OWwPhScjKw&oe=69E775FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BM5E_4bR2QgQ7kNvwHYhEtp&_nc_oc=AdpDrX-Zt6_fbN-HbK2v-zIYsc6ECDPFWYTMlcxwCdeeGKLzALhrdkY-FS5D92w03tw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2-2CTghNLKA7tQG-ih_PyC7H3xTJXV6gEJv4ps1O0_Tw&oe=69E7774A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UVSE20BFOdAQ7kNvwE5CR_a&_nc_oc=AdrZrl4jiRp0LLGSx3h2IKpJFRQOc1bHWaXEOEPDYfbdVhhf_bcazGZoPyc8cuYbKLs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Mj5BmU-f6eN27qtqCgdoUQh0V94kBQKqTrydofMSczg&oe=69E7607E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se